            {
                "entry_id": "b7a20722-f7b9-398c-8c2d-fc43678cb01a",
                "word": "kirtled",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d199baf0-32e1-3603-b7ab-b4af1aea6450",
                        "entry_id": "b7a20722-f7b9-398c-8c2d-fc43678cb01a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clothed or covered with, or as if with, a kirtle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33a92500-f237-47d0-b4a2-892d1988fa15",
                                "sense_id": "d199baf0-32e1-3603-b7ab-b4af1aea6450",
                                "text": "I have oft heard\nMy mother Circe with the Sirens three,\nAmidſt the flowery-kirtled Naiades,\nCulling their potent herbs, and baleful drugs,\nWho, as they ſung, would take the priſon'd ſoul,\nAnd lap it in Elyſium; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56b205a6-85a8-438a-9b40-1a60927764b7",
                                "sense_id": "d199baf0-32e1-3603-b7ab-b4af1aea6450",
                                "text": "And bounding hand in hand, man link'd to man,\nYelling their uncouth dirge, long daunced the kirtled clan"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb45916c-47a4-4399-bc99-1a7435b5bb26",
                                "sense_id": "d199baf0-32e1-3603-b7ab-b4af1aea6450",
                                "text": "From out that beaming look, to know what thoughts\nWithin the barb-leaved hart's-tongue dwell—\nThe purple eye petalled with snow, that floats\nSo gracefully:—dost think the damosel,\nYoung Hope, kirtled with Chastity, there fell\nInto the stream, and grew a flower so fair?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e2c6033-ef0e-42a2-b46e-a8281e9411f4",
                                "sense_id": "d199baf0-32e1-3603-b7ab-b4af1aea6450",
                                "text": "[…] [W]e had more recently an importation of wild Albanians kirtled to the knee, some eleven hundred of them, the forerunners of larger detachments,—on their way to the Hedjoz on service,—and these things, some folks said, were significant."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
